---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import EntityArticle from '../../components/v2/templates/EntityArticle.astro';
import { entityImages } from '../../data/images';
import { getPageSEO } from '../../utils/seo';
const pageSEO = getPageSEO('equipment-deluxe-stove');
---

<BaseLayout pageId="equipment-deluxe-stove" breadcrumbs={[{ label: 'Home', href: '/' }, { label: 'Equipment', href: '/equipment/' }, { label: 'Stoves', href: '/equipment/stoves/' }, { label: pageSEO.h1 }]}>
<EntityArticle
  title={pageSEO.h1}
  kicker="Equipment profile"
  intro="The Deluxe Stove is a named cooking-equipment entry in the Karinderya Stove directory."
  heroImage={entityImages.deluxeStove}
  tableOfContents
  previousPage={{ label: 'Standard Stove', href: '/equipment/standard-stove/' }}
  relatedLinks={[
    { label: 'Equipment Hub', href: '/equipment/', description: 'Browse restaurant equipment categories and usage guidance.' },
    { label: 'Stoves Directory', href: '/equipment/stoves/', description: 'Browse every Stove entry currently covered by the Wiki.' },
    { label: 'Cooking and Serving Guide', href: '/guides/cooking-and-serving/', description: 'Follow cooking as part of the complete restaurant service workflow.' },
    { label: 'Beginner Guide', href: '/guides/beginner-guide/', description: 'Learn the main restaurant systems and how they connect.' },
  ]}
>
  <h2 id="short-answer">Short Answer</h2>
  <p>Deluxe Stove is a named stove shown in dated Karinderya placement footage. Historical community records also associate it with old milestone codes, but those records do not establish its current acquisition route.</p>

  <h2 id="overview">Overview</h2>
  <p>The available capture confirms the name and Stoves category. Reliable current evidence does not establish its price, cooking-time difference, capacity, or unlock requirement.</p>

  <h2 id="how-it-works">How It Works</h2>
  <p>Select the Deluxe Stove from owned inventory when it is present, then place it through the current customization interface. Follow current cooking prompts rather than assuming performance from the name.</p>

  <h2 id="usage">How Players Obtain It</h2>
  <p>Old community code records are historical context only. Check current official code listings, owned inventory, and the live shop; this page does not present an expired milestone reward as a current method.</p>

  <h2 id="gameplay-tips">Gameplay Tips</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Keep the cooking area connected with ingredient preparation and serving routes.</li>
    <li>Use the Equipment Hub when reviewing other restaurant tools and work areas.</li>
    <li>Consult the Cooking and Serving Guide for the full order workflow.</li>
  </ul>
</EntityArticle>
</BaseLayout>
